# Tag of github.com/packagegraph/ontology that the ETL image is built
# against. Single source of truth: read by the build-etl validation job in
# .github/workflows/ci.yml and by .github/workflows/images.yml for every
# published image, so a release ships whatever this file said at that commit.
#
# Coupled to etl/scripts/sync-ontology.sh, which verifies an exact module
# allowlist for this version ("v0.13.0: 37 modules"). Bump both in the same
# commit or the sync step fails the allowlist check.
#
# Comments and blank lines are ignored; the first bare value wins.
v0.13.0
